        },
        "description": "\nA novice female adventurer. She names the kitten she found in the labyrinth \"Tama\" and keeps him as her pet. She aspires to be like the \"Sword Saint\" Alisha, who single-handedly repelled the demons that once attacked her hometown.\n\nShe specializes in high-speed combat, taking advantage of her skill, \"Acceleration.\" She has a diligent and kind-hearted personality, but when it comes to Tama, she sometimes displays hints of a rather intense fetish.\n\n(Source: Official Site)",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": null
      },
