        "description": "\nA girl of unknown origin whom Tama and Aria encounter inside the labyrinth. For some reason, she refers to Tama as the \"strong one\" and urges him to have her child. She lacks any kind of common sense, and Aria and the others believe she has lost her memory. But her true identity is actually...?\n\n(Source: Official Site)",
