        "description": "\nA tiger-eared blacksmith who runs the \"Vulcan's Armory\" in Labyrinthos and is Aria's friend. She is also a C-rank adventurer, wielding a giant hammer with her innate brute strength. She has a laid-back personality, but her skills are the real deal, and she provides Aria with helpful advice. On the other hand, she can be rather shy when it comes to Tama...!?\n\n(Source: Official Site)",
