        "description": "\nOne of the heroes who brought victory to humanity during the “Twilight of the Demon Gods”, a huge war between demons and humans. Called the “Sword Saint” because of her ability to wield two longswords. When Aria’s village, Lumines, was attacked by the demon armies, she saved it all alone. The woman who saved Aria’s life, and the woman that Aria admires.\n\n(Source: Official Site)",
